<title>USA: Value City names Martin Doolan president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Value City names Martin Doolan president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value City Department Stores Inc said Wednesday it has named Martin Doolan president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Doolan replaces former president George Iacono, who resigned in May.</p>
<p>The company also said it has named Michael Tanner chief operating officer.</p>
